      "equation": "$$\\begin{gathered}\\widehat\\phi_j=\\phi'_j+\\widehat\\phi_\\Delta,\\qquad U=M^{-1}\\\\M_{j,:}=\\begin{bmatrix}1&\\frac{\\widehat m}{2}e^{i\\widehat\\phi_j}&\\frac{\\widehat m}{2}e^{-i\\widehat\\phi_j}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{gathered}$$",
